{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/16/2905025/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛が明るくなりすぎてしまい\n久しぶりに会ったおばあちゃんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ロシアの人みたいねぇ！いや、でも顔はインドかしら？ははは」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われ、国籍がいよいよ\n分からなくなってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本です。\n純日本人です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/16/2905025/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしいの見つけた...(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ナマステ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ChihaFood"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し前の名古屋の握手会で\n差し入れで頂いたケーキ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「chez Shibata」さんの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/16/2905025/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキの中ではチョコケーキが一番好きなので\n真っ先に選びました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても美味しかったのですが\nいまホームページを見て調べたら\nこのケーキはもうないのかな...？？\nもしかしたらないのかも..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう食べられないと思うと寂しいです(o_o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも別のケーキも美味しそうなの沢山あったので\n今度はそのケーキ食べたいなあ( ´ｰ`)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋に来た際、\n名古屋の皆さんは是非！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「アイデンティティ」サカナクションさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サカナクションさんの個性も\nリズムも声も全て好きだけど\nこの曲の歌詞が本当に好き。\nそれぞれが思い悩む気持ちを\n上手に表されていてかっこいい。\n\"どうしてまだ見えない自分らしさってやつに\n朝は来るのか\"\n\"どうして見えなかった自分らしさってやつに\n解りはじめた\"\n1番と2番の歌詞のラストの\n変化も好き。\nアイデンティティとは何か。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/16/2905025/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"墓女見終わった後に\n絢音ちゃんに良かったよ！と伝えたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"困り笑顔で親指グッ！と立ててくれた◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いd(￣ ￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}